**********************************************************************
*                                                                    *
*                                                                    *
*      HOP 400 INITIALIZE SUBROUTINE                                 *J
*                                                                    *
*                                                                    *
**********************************************************************

* FUNCTION   THE HOP 400 INITIALIZE SUBROUTINE INITIALIZES THE
*            INTERRUPT HOP 400 ADDRESS IN EVERY MODULE PRESENT IN THE
*            LVDC. WHEN AN INTERRUPT IS ENCOUNTERED DURING PRELAUNCH,
*            THE HOP 400 ADDRESS IS UTILIZED IN REACHING THE PREFLIGHT
*            INTERRUPT PROCESSOR SUBROUTINE.

* ENTRY      KIN400   ENTER TO INITIALIZE HOP 400 LOCATIONS

       ORG     FBR1,D.DATA

IN400S BSS     1
MODCNT BSS     1
MODMSK BSS     1

       USE     DAT
ININST CDSS    0,0
       STO     400
       USE     INST

KIN400 STO     777
       CLA     777
       STO     IN400S       STORE HOP RETURN IN IN400S                B

       CLA     MESMAP       PICK UP MESMAP TO DETERMINE MODULES IN USEB
       AND     =O776        MASK OUT ALL BUT VALID MODULE BITS (S-8)  B
       STO     MODMSK       STORE MODULE MAP FOR DOWNSTREAM REFERENCE B

       CLA     D.KZRO
       STO     MODCNT       INITIALIZE MODULE COUNTER

       CLA     MODMSK
IN400A TMI     IN400B       DOES MOD. MAP SHOW MOD. UNDER TEST PRESENTQ
       TNZ     IN400C       DO ANY OTHER MODULES REMAIN               Q
*                           ALL MODULES INDICATED IN MAP NOW INIT.    B
*                           FIXME: THE BELOW IS DUBIOUS
       CLA     000          PERFORM CLA 000 FROM ODD DATA MODULE      B
*                           THIS IS TO FORCE MEMORY B LATCH ALIGNMENT B
       CDS     IN400S       CDS BACK FOR HOP EXIT                     B
       HOP     IN400S       HOP BACK                                  X

IN400B CLA     D.KZRO       FIXME                                     Y
       STO     775          SET PQ = INTERRUPT PROCESSING HOP CONSTANTB

       CLA     ININST       PICK UP USE DAT OF COS 0,0 AND STO 400    B
       XOR     MODCNT       INSERT MODULE COUNTER                     B
       HOP     IEDA         STO INT HPC IN MODULE X                   B

IN400C CLA     MODCNT
       ADD     D.KB6        INCREMENT MODULE COUNTER BY 1             M
       STO     MODCNT

       CLA     MODMSK
       SHL     1            ROTATE MODULE MAP LEFT 1 POSITION         M
       STO     MODMSK
       TRA     IN400A       GO TO TEST FOR NEXT MODULE PRESENT        B
